        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Ejira 4.24–5.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok pa Rwot yam obino bot lanebi Jekaria wod pa Berekia, wod pa Iddo, i dwe me aboro, i mwaka me loc pa Dario me aryone, kun wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kiniga yam omako Rwot matek i kom kwariwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno in iwac botgi ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Wudwog bota, an bene abidwogo botwu, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wubed macalo kwariwu ma yam lunebi macon gibedo ka tito botgi lok ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, ‘Wuwek kit mewu maraco ki tim mewu maraco ducu.’ Ento yam pe gumedo ki winyone, pe guketo cwinygi i koma, man lok pa Rwot kikome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwariwu kombeddi gitye wa kwene mono? Ki lunebi gibedo kwo nakanaka ce? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lokka ki cikka ma con aciko ki luticca ma lunebi pe ceŋ gumako kwarowu i waŋayo? Omiyo gin guŋut kun giwacci, Rwot me mony doŋ otiyo kit ma yam en oyubo kwede pi timowa muporo kitwa ki tim mewa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok pa Rwot con obino bot Jekaria wod pa Berekia, wod pa Iddo, i kom nino dwe pyeraryo wiye aŋwen, i dwe me apar wiye acel, ma gilwoŋo ni Cebat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dwe Cebat",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "pa jo Icrael mito rom ki dwe me aryo ma mewa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", i mwaka pa Dario me aryone Jekaria ocako wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.2+REV.6.3+REV.6.4+REV.6.5+REV.6.6+REV.6.7+REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 6.2-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aneno dano mo i dyewor, ma oyito wi aguragura makwar, ocuŋ kwede i kin yadi ma ŋwecgi kur ma gitye i luŋ; ki tuŋ yo ŋeye onoŋo tye iye lwak aguragura makwar ki ma opilopilo, ki matarre, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acako penyo ni, ‘Magi gin aŋo, ladit?’ Ci lumalaika ma onoŋo obedo ka lok kweda-ni owacca ni, ‘Abinyuto kit ma gitye kwede boti.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano ma onoŋo ocuŋ i kin yadi ma ŋwecgi kur-ri ocako gamo ni, ‘Magi gin aye lwak jo ma Rwot oorogi ka wirre pi loŋo i lobo ducu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin gucako dwoko lok bot lamalaika ma onoŋo ocuŋ i kin yadi ma ŋwecgi kur kun giwacci, ‘Doŋ watyeko wirre ka loŋo i lobo ducu; nen, i lobo ducu tye mukwe gire mot.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen lamalaika pa Rwot dok openyo ni, ‘Ai Rwot me mony, ibitero kare ma rom mene ma noŋo peya itimo kica ki Jerucalem, kacel ki gaŋi ma i Juda-gu, ma in doŋ ikeco i komgi pi mwaka pyerabiro kulu-ni?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot odok iye ki lamalaika mubedo ka lok kweda-ni, kun wacce lok mabeco me kica bene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo lamalaika mubedo ka lok kweda-ni owacca ni, ‘Tit lok man kun idaŋŋe matek ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Nyeko tye ka maka matek ma kato ducu pi Jerucalem ki pi Cion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiniga maka matek i kom rok mapol ma gitye ki kuc; pien i kare ma kiniga maka iye manoknok-ki, en aye dok kare ma gin bene gimedo iye lwak can mapol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno omiyo Rwot owacci, An doŋ atyeko dwogo cen i Jerucalem ki kica madwoŋ, gibigero iye oda, man lok pa Kwot me mony kikome, doŋ gibicako ryeyo tol me pimo Jerucalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok imed daŋŋe ki lok man ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, Gaŋina ducu gin mabeco bidurre iye lipim doki, ci Rwot dok bikweyo cwiny Cion ka dok biyero Jerucalem aye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiŋo waŋa malo ci aneno tuŋ lee aŋwen! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci apenyo lamalaika ma obedo ka lok kweda-ni ni, “Magi kit gin aŋo?” En odokka iye ni, “Magi gin aye tuŋ lee ma gukeyo i Juda woko atata, ki Icrael ki Jerucalem bene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot dok onyutta lutet aŋwen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acako penyo ni, “Jo-nu gubino ka timo kit gin aŋo kaa?” En ogamo ni, “Magi gin aye tuŋ lee ma yam gukeyo i Juda woko atata-ni, omiyo ŋatti mo pe oette ka tiŋo iye wiye. Jo-nu gubino pi miyogi lworo, ki pi reto tuŋ rok ducu woko piny ma yam gutiŋo tuŋgi me twomo ki lobo Juda wek iye oket woko atata.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
